        <mxCell id="surf_note" parent="surf_grp" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=9;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#888888;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" value="(surface/graph.py) — generic, builds a TESPy&lt;br&gt;Network from a YAML power_plant.nodes/edges&lt;br&gt;block (any topology, not hardcoded). Superseded&lt;br&gt;the earlier hardcoded SingleFlashSurface&lt;br&gt;(deleted 2026-07-20). CPG/ORC-specific fluid&lt;br&gt;support is still open — see vision doc." vertex="1">
